# Screenshot to editable PowerPoint

When the user gives a screenshot (or Fit-to-Window capture) and wants a PowerPoint, follow the skill `screenshot-to-editable-ppt`.

- Rebuild with **native shapes and text**. Do not paste the screenshot as a picture.
- Do not deliver until `source_audit.py`, `verify_pptx.py`, **and** `compare_render.py` all pass.
- After ANY modification, rebuild and re-run all three gates.
